{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. Where the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies.\n\n[[cite:obs-ccc73f28b8f4f966b520567d6ad29dea55194a50 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n[[cite:obs-ccc73f28b8f4f966b520567d6ad29dea55194a50 \"# CFO directive of 1 July 2026\"]]","expected_sha256":"8d07a5c6ace44eef23c8280dc7333792f980c8e8ce718a47376785505b32009c","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Added the single-signature purchase limit as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026, stating that it overrides the procurement policy where they differ, with exact citations from the directive source."}